{"id":335,"slug":"335-typescript-strict-mode-bao-gom-nhung-gi","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Types Nhập Môn","level":"beginner","question_vi":"TypeScript strict mode bao gồm những gì?","question_en":"What does TypeScript strict mode include?","answer_vi":"`\"strict\": true` bật **một nhóm cờ** kiểm tra chặt cùng lúc:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true\n    // bật kèm: strictNullChecks, noImplicitAny, strictFunctionTypes,\n    // strictBindCallApply, strictPropertyInitialization, noImplicitThis,\n    // alwaysStrict, useUnknownInCatchVariables (TS 4.4+),\n    // strictBuiltinIteratorReturn (TS 5.6+)\n  }\n}\n```\n\nHai cờ có tác động lớn nhất:\n\n```typescript\n// strictNullChecks — cờ giá trị nhất trong cả nhóm\nfunction len(s: string | null) {\n  return s.length      // Lỗi: 's' is possibly 'null'\n}\n\n// noImplicitAny — không cho tham số lọt qua mà không có kiểu\nfunction f(x) { }      // Lỗi: Parameter 'x' implicitly has an 'any' type\n```\n\n`useUnknownInCatchVariables` (TS 4.4) hay gây bối rối khi nâng cấp dự án cũ:\n\n```typescript\ntry { risky() }\ncatch (e) {\n  e.message            // Lỗi: 'e' is of type 'unknown'\n  if (e instanceof Error) e.message   // đúng\n}\n```\n\nChuyển dự án JavaScript sang TypeScript thì bật dần, không bật hết một lần:\n\n```json\n{ \"noImplicitAny\": true }        // bước 1\n{ \"strictNullChecks\": true }     // bước 2 — nặng nhất, làm sau cùng\n```\n\n**Chốt:** dự án mới luôn bật `strict: true` ngay từ đầu. Bật sau khi đã có hàng nghìn dòng code sẽ sinh ra hàng trăm lỗi cùng lúc, và phần lớn dự án chọn cách tắt đi thay vì sửa — đó là lúc TypeScript mất phần lớn giá trị của nó","answer_en":"`\"strict\": true` enables **a family of flags** at once:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true\n    // turns on: strictNullChecks, noImplicitAny, strictFunctionTypes,\n    // strictBindCallApply, strictPropertyInitialization, noImplicitThis,\n    // alwaysStrict, useUnknownInCatchVariables (TS 4.4+),\n    // strictBuiltinIteratorReturn (TS 5.6+)\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe two with the biggest impact:\n\n```typescript\n// strictNullChecks — the most valuable flag of the set\nfunction len(s: string | null) {\n  return s.length      // Error: 's' is possibly 'null'\n}\n\n// noImplicitAny — no untyped parameters slipping through\nfunction f(x) { }      // Error: Parameter 'x' implicitly has an 'any' type\n```\n\n`useUnknownInCatchVariables` (TS 4.4) is the one that confuses people upgrading older projects:\n\n```typescript\ntry { risky() }\ncatch (e) {\n  e.message            // Error: 'e' is of type 'unknown'\n  if (e instanceof Error) e.message   // correct\n}\n```\n\nMigrating a JavaScript project means enabling them gradually, not all at once:\n\n```json\n{ \"noImplicitAny\": true }        // step 1\n{ \"strictNullChecks\": true }     // step 2 — the heaviest, save it for last\n```\n\n**Takeaway:** new projects should start with `strict: true`. Turning it on after thousands of lines produces hundreds of errors at once, and most teams disable it again rather than fix them — which is where TypeScript loses most of its value","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>\"strict\": true</code> bật <strong>một nhóm cờ</strong> kiểm tra chặt cùng lúc:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"{\n  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {\n    &quot;strict&quot;: true\n    // bật kèm: strictNullChecks, noImplicitAny, strictFunctionTypes,\n    // strictBindCallApply, strictPropertyInitialization, noImplicitThis,\n    // alwaysStrict, useUnknownInCatchVariables (TS 4.4+),\n    // strictBuiltinIteratorReturn (TS 5.6+)\n  }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;compilerOptions&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;strict&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bật kèm: strictNullChecks, noImplicitAny, strictFunctionTypes,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// strictBindCallApply, strictPropertyInitialization, noImplicitThis,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// alwaysStrict, useUnknownInCatchVariables (TS 4.4+),</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// strictBuiltinIteratorReturn (TS 5.6+)</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><p>Hai cờ có tác động lớn nhất:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// strictNullChecks — cờ giá trị nhất trong cả nhóm\nfunction len(s: string | null) {\n  return s.length      // Lỗi: 's' is possibly 'null'\n}\n\n// noImplicitAny — không cho tham số lọt qua mà không có kiểu\nfunction f(x) { }      // Lỗi: Parameter 'x' implicitly has an 'any' type\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// strictNullChecks — cờ giá trị nhất trong cả nhóm</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">len</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">s</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> | <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Lỗi: &#x27;s&#x27; is possibly &#x27;null&#x27;</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// noImplicitAny — không cho tham số lọt qua mà không có kiểu</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span>) { }      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Lỗi: Parameter &#x27;x&#x27; implicitly has an &#x27;any&#x27; type</span></code></pre></div><p><code>useUnknownInCatchVariables</code> (TS 4.4) hay gây bối rối khi nâng cấp dự án cũ:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"try { risky() }\ncatch (e) {\n  e.message            // Lỗi: 'e' is of type 'unknown'\n  if (e instanceof Error) e.message   // đúng\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">risky</span>() }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (e) {\n  e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">message</span>            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Lỗi: &#x27;e&#x27; is of type &#x27;unknown&#x27;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (e <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">instanceof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span>) e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">message</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// đúng</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p>Chuyển dự án JavaScript sang TypeScript thì bật dần, không bật hết một lần:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"{ &quot;noImplicitAny&quot;: true }        // bước 1\n{ &quot;strictNullChecks&quot;: true }     // bước 2 — nặng nhất, làm sau cùng\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;noImplicitAny&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bước 1</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;strictNullChecks&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bước 2 — nặng nhất, làm sau cùng</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Chốt:</strong> dự án mới luôn bật <code>strict: true</code> ngay từ đầu.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Bật sau khi đã có hàng nghìn dòng code sẽ sinh ra hàng trăm lỗi cùng lúc, và phần lớn dự án chọn cách tắt đi thay vì sửa — đó là lúc TypeScript mất phần lớn giá trị của nó.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>\"strict\": true</code> enables <strong>a family of flags</strong> at once:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"{\n  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {\n    &quot;strict&quot;: true\n    // turns on: strictNullChecks, noImplicitAny, strictFunctionTypes,\n    // strictBindCallApply, strictPropertyInitialization, noImplicitThis,\n    // alwaysStrict, useUnknownInCatchVariables (TS 4.4+),\n    // strictBuiltinIteratorReturn (TS 5.6+